# Windows runners often use core.autocrlf=true; gofmt requires LF in working tree.
*.go   text eol=lf
go.mod text eol=lf
go.sum text eol=lf

# 提交进仓库的海康运行时二进制：一律不做文本转换，也不参与 diff。
# 厂商的 .ini/.properties 是带 BOM 的文本，core.autocrlf 下会被 CRLF 改写从而破坏哈希。
runtime/** -text
*.dll      binary
*.lib      binary
*.so       binary
*.so.*     binary
*.cti      binary
